OL,3,AAlexander brothers each sentenced to 30
OL,4,Ayears in prison for sex trafficking
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Your conduct was monstrous," said
OL,8,FJudge Valerie Caproni before sentencing
OL,9,Fthem. "Your crimes wreaked havoc on
OL,10,Ftheir lives."
OL,12,FOn Tuesday morning, the court in New
OL,13,FYork heard from 12 victims, including
OL,14,Fone who did not testify during the
OL,15,Ftrial.
